   "displayName": "Early Access Status Update",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2021-09-17T14:00:39.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "While we can't wait for you to experience the explosive action and adventure of Blast Brigade vs. The Evil Legion of Dr. Cread with the launch of Early Access, we have decided to take some extra time for additional polishing based on the feedback we received from content creators who previewed the game. We want to ensure we can provide the best experience and lots of content for this big milestone, which is still coming later this year.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Very soon, we will be able to share not only more details about Early Access, but also exciting news on other topics. Stay tuned and make sure to add Blast Brigade to your wishlist on Steam to receive all future notifications and news.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, have a blast!",
